      "order": 4,
      "depth": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Govardhanesha Perumal\nThayaar: Satyabhama Nachiyar\nVimanam: Govardhana Vimanam\nPushkarani: Yamuna Nadi\n\nTravel: Sri Krishna Janmabhoomi is located in Mathura, whereas the Divyadesam temple is situated in Vrindavan.\n\nAzhwar Pasuram:\nPeriya Azhwar: 16 Pasurams\nSri Andal: 19 Pasurams\nThondaradipodi Azhwar: 1 pasuram\nTirumangai Azhwar: 4 Pasurams\nNam Azhwar: 10 Pasurams\nTotal: 50 Pasurams",
